/// 
/// Often referred to as a "list-of-lists" or "array-of-arrays" construction.
/// 
/// For example to store the following three arrays as a jagged array:
/// (a b c)
/// (d e f g)
/// (h)
/// Elements = (a b c d e f g h)
/// Cumulative Length = (3 7 8)
